 idea"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The AI identifies the subjects and setting in your description, then asks focused questions about each. An idea about a barista pouring a latte can become separate questions about the barista, drink, café, and scene. Multi-select answers allow compatible details to coexist."}]]}],["$","div","One prompt for each platform",{"className":"feature","children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"One prompt for each platform"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Answers become a coherent description, then deterministic compilers add the platform-specific structure. Image targets include Midjourney, DALL·E, and Higgsfield; video targets include Higgsfield, Veo 3, and Runway."}]]}],["$","div","Visible gaps before you spend",{"className":"feature","children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Visible gaps before you spend"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"A completeness meter counts unanswered required fields. You can fill them in or explicitly choose to compile anyway. Technical choices such as aspect ratio and duration remain direct controls."}]]}],["$","div","A way to test the idea itself",{"className":"feature","children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"A way to test the idea itself"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"After copying a prompt, you can record whether the result worked first time, needed more attempts, or was abandoned. Local statistics compare complete and incomplete specs. Reduced regeneration is a hypothesis being measured, not a promised result."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"how-it-works","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"section-marker","children":"How it works"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"From idea to action."}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"workflow","children":[["$","li","Describe the idea",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"step-number","aria-hidden":"true","children":["0",1]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Describe the idea"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Choose image or video and enter what you wa